<style>
  .container { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; }
  .header { background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 20px; text-align: center; border-bottom: 2px solid #ddd; }
  .content { padding: 20px; }
  .order-info { background-color: #f9f9f9; padding: 15px; border-radius: 5px; margin: 20px 0; }
  .footer { font-size: 12px; color: #777; text-align: center; margin-top: 30px; }
  .price { font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: #e44d26; }
</style>

<div class="container">
  <div class="header">
    <h1>Order Confirmed!</h1>
  </div>
  <div class="content">
    <p>Hello <strong>{{name}}</strong>,</p>
    <p>Thank you for choosing BenGo! Your order has been successfully placed and is now being processed.</p>
    
    <div class="order-info">
      <p><strong>Order ID:</strong> #{{id}}</p>
      <p><strong>Vehicle:</strong> {{vehicleType}}</p>
      <p><strong>From:</strong> {{pickup}}</p>
      <p><strong>To:</strong> {{dropoff}}</p>
      <p><strong>Total Price:</strong> <span class="price">{{price}} VND</span></p>
    </div>

    <p>We will notify you once a driver has accepted your order.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="footer">
    <p>&copy; 2026 BenGo. All rights reserved.</p>
  </div>
</div>
